{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/704","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/704/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/704/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/704/events","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/704","id":5522558840,"node_id":"I_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABSSuPeA","number":704,"title":"Curator calls surfaced by the #699 review: Na2-citrate on trisodium citrate, Tricine on a grouping class, ledgers that can re-propose retired names","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-21T03:59:03Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T09:02:06Z","closed_at":"2026-09-24T09:02:06Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Three findings from reviewers on #699 that need a ruling rather than a rule, filed together because each is small.\n\n**1. `Na2-citrate` is an `EXACT_SYNONYM` on the Trisodium citrate record.** By nomenclature Na2-citrate is *disodium hydrogen* citrate, a different salt from Na3. #699's test cannot see it: that test fires when ChEBI assigns the name to another term, and this ChEBI build has no disodium citrate term at all. The 2026-04-19 `audit_mim_merge` absorbed `Na2-citrate.yaml` *and* `Citric_Acid_2.yaml` / `Citric_Acid_3.yaml` into the trisodium record — so the merge itself conflated an acid and two salts, and summed their occurrence counts. #699 retires `Citric Acid` there; whether recipe rows whose raw label is \"Citric Acid\" or \"Na2-citrate\" still count toward this record's 182 occurrences was not checked.\n\n**2. The Tricine record maps to a structureless grouping class.** `Tricine.yaml` → `CHEBI:46760 tricine`, which in this build has a label and nothing else: no formula, no InChIKey, no definition. Its children are `CHEBI:39063` (the neutral form, which owns the structure and the systematic names) and `CHEBI:46759` (the zwitterion). Section 3 asks for the most specific stable identifier; CHEBI:39063 looks like it, and the three tricine names #699 retired from *Lithocholic acid* would be legitimate synonyms there. The record has CAS 5704-04-1 and 44 occurrences.\n\n**3. Two tracked review ledgers still list the cadmium names against calcium nitrate.** `mappings/ingredient_mappings_synonym_enrich_review.tsv` (line 98, `ALREADY_REPRESENTED`) and `mappings/ingredient_mappings_oak_ols_review.tsv` (line 441, verdict `SYNONYM_ENRICH`). They are historical artifacts and probably how the names got in. The backfill is safe — it treats a `REJECTED_LABEL` entry as already present — but a re-run of *that enrichment* reading these ledgers could re-propose them. Either regenerate the ledgers or have the enrichment honour `REJECTED_LABEL`.\n\nSmaller, same records: several carry a stale first `evidence` entry (`DATABASE_MATCH`, \"quality=DIRECT_MATCH\") that was produced for the original *wrong* mapping and now sits under the corrected `ontology_id`, reading as database support for a mapping it never supported.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01BP6MDZgidgzS79c75Ykhac","closed_by":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/704/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/704/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}